
# What this project adds on top of gem5. The image carries no git history, so
# this matters once a repository is made here: git status then shows changed
# gem5 sources rather than the tooling and the documents that came with the
# image. gem5's own entries, build/ and m5out among them, are above.
scripts/
gem5_configs/
benchmarks/
results/
